('6bc3f6ef-8705-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'support', 'What do the different order statuses mean?', 'status,order,pending,preparing,ready,delivered', 'Order statuses track progress through your restaurant:

🟡 **Pending** - Order placed, waiting to be started
