Orders automatically route to the correct station (Kitchen for food, Barista for drinks) and staff get real-time notifications!', 80, 1, '2026-07-24 05:14:37', '2026-07-24 05:14:37'),
('6bc3f737-8705-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'support', 'Can I customize the POS layout?', 'customize,pos,layout,design,change,modify,arrange', 'Yes! You can customize several aspects:

