• Can view data, can''t add new
• Operations paused

✅ **Good News:**
• Your data is NEVER deleted
• Renew anytime to restore access
• All history preserved

We recommend renewing before expiry for uninterrupted service.', 90, 1, '2026-07-24 05:14:37', '2026-07-24 05:14:37'),
('6bc46696-8705-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'billing', 'How do I view my invoices?', 'invoice,receipt,bill,payment,history,transaction', 'To view your invoices:

1. Go to **Settings** > **Subscription**
2. Click **"Payment History"**
3. See all past transactions
4. Click any invoice to view/download

📄 Each invoice shows:
• Invoice number
• Plan details
• Amount paid
• Payment method
• Date

Need a specific invoice? Contact our billing team!', 85, 1, '2026-07-24 05:14:37', '2026-07-24 05:14:37'),
('6bc466fd-8705-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'billing', 'Can I get a refund?', 'refund,money,back,return,cancel,cancellation', 'Our refund policy:

✅ **Eligible for Refund:**
• Within 14 days of payment
• Technical issues preventing use
• Duplicate payments

❌ **Not Eligible:**
• After 14 days
• Partial period usage
• Change of mind after extensive use

📝 **To Request:**
1. Contact support with reason
2. Provide payment details
3. We''ll review within 48 hours

We handle each case individually and fairly.', 80, 1, '2026-07-24 05:14:37', '2026-07-24 05:14:37'),
('6bc46750-8705-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'billing', 'Do you offer monthly billing?', 'monthly,billing,payment,plan,subscribe,pay', 'Currently, our plans are:

• **Free Trial** - 2 months
