• More stable pricing
• Less payment hassle

🔜 **Coming Soon:**
We''re considering monthly options for Premium and Enterprise. Contact sales to express interest!

The Free Trial lets you test everything before committing.', 75, 1, '2026-07-24 05:14:37', '2026-07-24 05:14:37'),
('7b694d4c-86d2-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'general', 'What is ProManage?', 'what,promanage,about,system', 'ProManage is a complete restaurant management ERP system that helps you manage orders, inventory, staff, billing, and analytics all in one place. It''s designed specifically for restaurants, cafes, and food service businesses.', 100, 1, '2026-07-23 23:09:59', '2026-07-23 23:09:59'),
('7b695b30-86d2-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'general', 'How does ProManage work?', 'how,work,function,operate', 'ProManage works as a cloud-based system accessible from any device. Your staff can take orders via the POS, which automatically routes to Kitchen and Barista stations. Inventory is tracked in real-time, and you get comprehensive analytics and reports.', 95, 1, '2026-07-23 23:09:59', '2026-07-23 23:09:59'),
('7b695c63-86d2-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'sales', 'What are the pricing plans?', 'price,pricing,cost,plans,subscription', 'We offer flexible pricing plans:
• Free Trial: 2 months free, then 6,000 Br/renewal (6 staff)
• Basic: 9,000 Br for 3 months (12 staff)
• Premium: 18,000 Br for 6 months (15 staff)
• Enterprise: 36,000 Br for 12 months (unlimited staff)

All plans include core features. Visit our pricing page for more details!', 100, 1, '2026-07-23 23:09:59', '2026-07-23 23:09:59'),
('7b695cd6-86d2-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'sales', 'Is there a free trial?', 'free,trial,test,demo', 'Yes! We offer a 2-month free trial with all core features included and support for up to 6 staff members. No credit card required to start. After the trial, you can choose a plan that fits your needs.', 95, 1, '2026-07-23 23:09:59', '2026-07-23 23:09:59'),
('7b695d3a-86d2-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'sales', 'How do I get started?', 'start,begin,signup,register', 'Getting started is easy!
1. Click "Get Started" on our website
2. Fill out the registration form with your business details
3. Our team will contact you to set up your account
4. Start your free trial immediately!

Need help? Contact our sales team.', 90, 1, '2026-07-23 23:09:59', '2026-07-23 23:09:59'),
('7b695d9c-86d2-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'support', 'How do I add staff members?', 'add,staff,employee,user,member', 'To add staff members:
1. Go to Settings > Staff Management
2. Click "Add Staff"
3. Enter their details and select their role
4. Set their permissions
5. They''ll receive login credentials via email

Note: The number of staff depends on your subscription plan.', 90, 1, '2026-07-23 23:09:59', '2026-07-23 23:09:59'),
('7b695df7-86d2-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'support', 'How do I manage inventory?', 'inventory,stock,manage,track', 'ProManage provides comprehensive inventory management:
