2. Add your products and ingredients
3. Set low-stock alerts
4. Link recipes for automatic deduction
5. View stock reports and analytics

The system automatically tracks usage based on orders.', 85, 1, '2026-07-23 23:09:59', '2026-07-23 23:09:59'),
('7b695e57-86d2-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'support', 'What roles are available?', 'roles,permissions,access,staff', 'ProManage supports 7 distinct roles:
• Super Admin - Full system access
• Owner - Restaurant management
• Manager - Day-to-day operations
• Waiter - Order taking
• Cashier - Billing and payments
• Kitchen - Food preparation
• Barista - Beverage preparation

Each role has customizable permissions.', 85, 1, '2026-07-23 23:09:59', '2026-07-23 23:09:59'),
('7b695ee5-86d2-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'billing', 'How do I pay for subscription?', 'pay,payment,subscribe,telebirr', 'We accept payments via TeleBirr:
