Need help? Contact our billing team.', 90, 1, '2026-07-23 23:09:59', '2026-07-23 23:09:59'),
('7b695ffc-86d2-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'billing', 'Can I upgrade my plan?', 'upgrade,change,plan,switch', 'Yes, you can upgrade anytime!
