('f4710d23-86d6-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'general', 'What is ProManage ERP?', 'what,promanage,erp,about,system,software', 'ProManage is a comprehensive Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) system specifically designed for restaurants and food service businesses. It integrates all your operations including:

• **Point of Sale (POS)** - Fast order taking
• **Kitchen Display System** - Real-time order routing
• **Inventory Management** - Stock tracking & alerts
• **Staff Management** - Roles & permissions
• **Billing & Payments** - Complete financial tracking
• **Analytics & Reports** - Business insights

All accessible from any device, anywhere!', 100, 1, '2026-07-23 23:42:00', '2026-07-23 23:42:00'),
('f4712eed-86d6-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'general', 'How do I contact support?', 'contact,support,help,reach,phone,email,call', 'You can reach our support team through multiple channels:

