📞 **Phone**: +251 954 668 305
💬 **Live Chat**: Use this chat widget!

**Support Hours:**
• Monday - Friday: 8 AM - 8 PM
• Saturday: 9 AM - 5 PM
• Sunday: Emergency support only

For urgent issues, please call directly.', 95, 1, '2026-07-23 23:42:00', '2026-07-23 23:42:00'),
('f4712ff8-86d6-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'general', 'Is my data secure?', 'secure,security,data,safe,privacy,protection,encryption', 'Yes! We take security very seriously. ProManage implements:

🔒 **Data Encryption** - All data encrypted at rest and in transit
🔐 **Role-Based Access** - Staff only see what they need
🛡️ **Regular Backups** - Daily automated backups
📊 **Audit Logs** - Track all system activities
🏢 **Multi-Tenant Isolation** - Your data is completely separate

We comply with industry-standard security practices and regularly update our security measures.', 90, 1, '2026-07-23 23:42:00', '2026-07-23 23:42:00'),
('f47130f4-86d6-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'general', 'Can I access from mobile?', 'mobile,phone,tablet,app,android,ios,responsive', 'Absolutely! ProManage is fully responsive and works on:

📱 **Smartphones** - iOS & Android browsers
📲 **Tablets** - Perfect for tableside ordering
💻 **Laptops & Desktops** - Full feature access

No app download required - just open your browser and log in! The interface automatically adapts to your screen size for the best experience.', 85, 1, '2026-07-23 23:42:00', '2026-07-23 23:42:00'),
('f471316a-86d6-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'general', 'What languages are supported?', 'language,languages,english,amharic,translate,multilingual', 'Currently ProManage supports:

