4. Set availability
5. Link to inventory (optional)
6. Click **Save**

💡 **Tips:**
• Use clear, appetizing names
• Add good photos - increases sales!
• Set proper categories for easy navigation', 90, 1, '2026-07-23 23:42:00', '2026-07-23 23:42:00'),
('f471355f-86d6-11f1-bbd0-f446378376aa', 'support', 'How does inventory tracking work?', 'inventory,stock,track,ingredient,alert,low,manage', 'ProManage offers comprehensive inventory management:

